  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-no-touch-fish-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "0c488dad67a9c6c42bcd77f48804802d1ee546f1e28d09653ab6dd561495cc89",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6ff12157b77884f446b4e81cdf306293d220077b056b0506fcdb665daf57dd4",
      "text": "悟空的\n隔空小鱼",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "812ad5058e8d8c95aa08bec01544cc5dc638895e25d6659cbda06041a265f2ad",
      "text": "沙僧带来一个游戏，\n摆在铁扇公主的院子里。\n纸做的小河上，架着一座纸桥，\n河里有一条红色的纸鱼。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e9ee99485804da1e33203084db44cf13a3ad2f322dd9ad983eb507eac954dba7",
      "text": "悟空凑近一看：\n小鱼自己动了！谁也没碰它。\n它朝着小桥游过去。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a5cc15685c8b02d7f04c0ace559c14f82c418bff2e8b7c19a91f018b57364a3",
      "text": "悟空喊：“铁扇公主！\n是你用扇子扇的吧！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6e763405856aae20b224ce1090aad4ec0be312c98633fbc470e708b938852f96",
      "text": "铁扇公主举起扇子：\n扇子一动也没动。\n可小鱼还是游到了桥底下！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f5bb202adaa701867dc383eb5c05f828b017599b9f07f3d22227aba40342004",
      "text": "沙僧哈哈一笑，\n把手从纸板底下伸出来。\n他手里拿着一根磁棒！\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e890b4e3f349e3705175e7715671e74ab33fda09bcb6348e7860724855358eac",
      "text": "悟空问：“磁铁能吸住纸吗？”\n沙僧说：“找几样材料试一试。”\n木块、塑料片、铝片，还\n有钢片。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f407a6dc3c9b7f4228669072986d0181f104311d8ec12cb6b44705684d56833",
      "text": "磁棒碰碰木块——没反应。\n碰碰塑料片——还是没反应。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "824c86d8660c4bf7f2bf91de6ae5aecd94cfeee71bc2225b7e33346965d679fb",
      "text": "铁扇公主拿亮闪闪的铝片来试：\n“这是金属，一定能吸住！”\n可是没吸住。\n不是所有金属都能被磁铁吸住。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ae0da9acd7de7098fc2aafd2c6cde455a1cbe99ae0a2bbc2be54b73552ee0e08",
      "text": "最后试钢片。\n“啪！”钢片一下子跳到磁棒上。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "816e41f223e6276f963352f2e5fd4fdffd2bf21340f38a8a1893e480023fecae",
      "text": "悟空问：“小鱼肚子里有钢片吗？”\n沙僧打开小鱼肚子上的小口\n袋——\n真的有一小块钢片！\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "edfe87fd081479359449b81c5a80552a2d85d61d18e319840117d3513c394db4",
      "text": "沙僧在纸板底下移动磁棒。\n隔着纸板，磁铁也能拉着\n钢片走，\n所以小鱼就游起来啦！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1c5d89760ff03891cd4caa2e2b7bdada744906916a680b8bb483a0910f6803e0",
      "text": "悟空自己剪了一条纸鱼，\n也在纸板底下移动磁棒。\n可他的小鱼一动也不动。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6acff7ff5fedf4e0b4c46f84e05e58812f44b9bc69a518f14d974e8ff08c6c13",
      "text": "悟空客客气气地说：“请你\n游一下？”\n小鱼还是不动。\n铁扇公主躲在扇子后面偷偷笑。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "46124bd95ce82b8f096535e877bf5ebcdc211f828fff95b150b9c3bd68929b64",
      "text": "铁扇公主把那块钢片递给他，\n两人把钢片贴进小鱼肚子里。\n这下悟空的小鱼也会游了！\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4aa6e8a5f3c85a24622f98de41c403becc418d418c3656ed429714ed4a456d13",
      "text": "两条小鱼一条接一条，钻\n过纸桥，\n一直游进了纸池塘。\n悟空说：“谢谢你，磁铁！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
